# Expo & React Native Rules

## Expo SDK 56

- Always read versioned docs before using Expo APIs: https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v56.0.0/
- Use `npm install --legacy-peer-deps` for all dependency installations.
- jest@29 (NOT 30) — required for jest-expo 56 compatibility.

## react-native-mmkv v4

- Factory: `createMMKV()` (not `new MMKV()`).
- Delete: `storage.remove(key)` (not `storage.delete(key)`).
- Use `useState` lazy initializers for sync MMKV reads. No useEffect for initial load.

## ESLint

- Flat config in `eslint.config.js` (not `.eslintrc.js`). ESLint v10.
- React version pinned to `'19'` in settings to avoid plugin crashes.

## Navigation

- Never use `<Redirect>` as the sole return of a layout component — causes infinite loops.
- Use `useEffect` + `router.replace()` guarded by `useSegments()` for conditional navigation.

## Build

- Gradle pinned to 8.x via `plugins/withGradleProperties.js` (RN 0.83 incompatible with Gradle 9).
- `react-native-reanimated` Babel plugin is auto-configured by `babel-preset-expo`. Do NOT add it to `app.json` plugins.
